  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "**DI017 exact generic precedence**: exact closed registrations now beat open-generic registrations for single-service circular dependency traversal, matching Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection precedence and avoiding both false cycles and missed exact-registration cycles. | **DI017 optional registered dependencies**: optional/default-valued constructor parameters now participate in cycle analysis when the service is actually registered, while unregistered optional parameters remain non-edges. | **DI017 unknown keyed parameters**: a constructor parameter with an unknown inherited key no longer aborts analysis for the rest of the constructor, so other registered dependency edges still report cycles.",
